  "prefLabel": "We 205.01 Applicability",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "We 205.01 Applicability. Any interested person may petition the board to adopt, amend, or repeal a rule. The rules in this part shall apply to any rulemaking petition submitted pursuant to RSA 541-A:4.\n\nSource. #7307, eff 6-13-00; ss by #9178-A, eff 6-13-08",
